    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Plans and conditions",
     "texto": [
      "With **se** and the future subjunctive, the condition is possible: **Se for preciso, compro o pão** (if it's necessary, I'll buy the bread). In the other part, use the present or the simple future: **Eu levarei o vinho** (I will bring the wine)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Review",
     "texto": [
      "Remember: after **quando**, **assim que**, **se** in the sense of a real condition, use the future subjunctive. After **que** with a wish, use the present subjunctive."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
